  fishName: Venomgrub
  description: Small, slow, weak and extremely poisonous. The venom grub is generally
    considered not worth the trouble by most predators, and as an excellent challenge
    to Nyaalines. \n\n  Chef's Notes:\nNyaa, what trouble! First, we have to use
    steam them, to draw out the thin layer of poison on its skin. Then, we have to
    carefully- VERY CARFEULLY- remove the pressurised, poison-filled sacks on its
    back. Poke one too hard and they explode. Finally, special tools are needed to
    pull out the internal organs, each one coated in deadly poison, then roast the
    remaining flesh over a 400c flame, to drive out the last traces of poison in
    the meat. Finally, after all that effort, we have a tiny mound flavourless, textureless,
    colorless meat. Good grief!
  sprite: {fileID: -8455539998564936456, guid: 7ccfa97e9c9a0d9abb4dc8e2d908bcfc, type: 3}
